- `SOURCE` contains text addressed to the analyzer, copied verbatim: `ext SOURCE:1` "Vendored verbatim, unmodified, as a read-only skill-analyzer test fixture." and `ext SOURCE:2` "The directory name differs from the skill's own name on purpose; the analyzer must flag it."
